loom reach total=1692 standing=168 cadence=322 sung=755 unheard=937 ceiling=937
loom roster rows=63 lap=61 cadence=2
loom roster_cold guards=60 green=60 clean_before_first_edit=12 ended=shell_syntax_error_on_rewritten_runner
loom standing_equipment_control behaviors=34 refusals=9 tree_digest_behaviors=7
file tools/al/ales_suite_witness.rish the choir -- 240 registered, cold lotus/bin, bijection before the sing
file tools/al/ales_roster_witness.rish the every-lap half -- four refusals planted, two welcomes proven
file tools/fixtures/ales_roster_bijection_scan.sh the bijection both halves read, registrations taken from code rather than comments
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri ales_roster at tier lap, ales_suite at tier cadence, the tier prose carrying the new cost
file tools/fixtures/witness_reach_scan.sh ceiling 1,176 -> 937 with the reasoning beside it
file tools/fixtures/standing_equipment_run.sh the tree digest at open and close, and the refusal when they differ
file tools/fixtures/standing_equipment_control.sh seven behaviors inside a real git repository, both sides of the digest
file tools/s/standing_equipment_witness.rish the seven new control readings gated rather than printed
file construction/REDS.md %221 and %222 booked and closed; %220 folded and the 5,999-byte fold recital shelved
file construction/archive/REDS-fold-recital.md the fold history whole, link depth moved on the way out
file tools/fixtures/ales_sing_lock.sh one sing at a time -- sow_project.sh's shape, shared by reference
file tools/fixtures/ales_sing_lock_control.sh twelve behaviors, the held case planted against a live pid
file .gitignore the transient sing lock
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md the walk-back before the card was condensed
file active-designing/20260825-132121_a-choir-for-the-largest-unheard-family.md the argument, the cost, and what it does not reach
file construction/ITINERARY.md Now refilled, guard count 63, the cold-open directive carrying hold still while it runs
obs Two reds this round and both were mine, found by running rather than by reading. %221 the cold roster crossing my own edits, %222 a decision-grade cost taken from one cold-cache sample. The transferable half of the second is the one I want to carry: a measurement carries the conditions it was taken under, and warm-or-cold, alone-or-beside, one-sample-or-three each belong in the sentence with the figure.
recommend keep-going the equinox family at 123 is the next crux and it is the same shape one room over -- 937 witnesses still named by nothing, and the tier now exists to hold whatever a stopwatch says each choir costs; beside it a staleness gate on the cadence tier, which wants a lap count to measure against, and construction/REDS.md's headline fold recital, now one 6,000-byte sentence that should fold the way its own rows already do
